==Overview==
The Smooth Toilet is a [[Mythic]] [[Units|unit]] that was added in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]] and made obtainable in the [[Episode 77 Part 2 Update]].

== Appearance ==
The toilet seems to have six spider legs each having two prongs. Its weapons are two arms each also having two blades on each arm. At the render icon, it is not very visible to see a lot of details, but the best the eye can see is two purple grabbers attached to a purple toilet.

== Obtainment==
It can be obtained through [[Summoning]] with a 0.1%/1.4% chance. you can also get it from [[Trading]], buying from [[Marketplace]], or getting gifted it in the [[Post Office]].

