==Trivia==

*This unit is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Michael_Jackson_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Michael Jackson Toilet] from the main series.
*This unit is obtainable in the [[Episode 77 Part 2 Update|Episode 77 Part 2]]  being unobtainable in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]].
*This unit was presumably not supposed to be added in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]].
*This unit has a low range, similar to Ghost Cameraman, so this is not recommended to use.
*This unit is basically Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman with Ghost Cameraman's range.
*Cannot block stuns.
*This is the first unit to be added in one update and made obtainable in the next Update.
**It is also the first unit to have its rarity changed.  ([[Rare]] -> [[Mythic]])
**Currently, half of the body is buried due to a bug.

